The repository is organized as follows:

-At the root level of the repository:

Acc_data.Rproj R project file to facilitate reproducibility and organization of the analyses.

-raw_data. Folder intended to store the datasets used in the analyses.
-processed_data. Folder intended to store the outputs of the analyses.
-scripts.  Folder storing the scripts used in the analyses.

⚠️ The data are not publicly available and must be requested from the data owners.
